# Brother sync

Two people. Two GitHub copies. One shared video library (Stephen → Chris).

**Remotes**
- `origin` / `stephen` = `https://github.com/StephenZepeda/ai-video.git`
- `chris` = `https://github.com/ChrisZepeda147/ai-video.git`

**Which machine**
- `SHARED_LIBRARY_EXPORT_OWNER=stephen` in `scripts/.env` → Stephen. After a new video, export + `push-stephen`, then push both remotes.
- No that env → Chris. Do not set `stephen` on Chris. Do not `push-stephen`.

## Start of every agent session (both machines)

Before other work, sync brother code:

```powershell
git fetch origin
git pull --ff-only origin main
```

**Chris only** — after pull, import Stephen video packages:

```powershell
python scripts/shared_library_sync.py pull-import --skip-pull
```

Or one shot:

```powershell
python -c "from discovery.config import default_db_path, load_env; from discovery.store import DiscoveryStore; from discovery.brother_code_sync import run_session_start_sync; load_env(); s=DiscoveryStore(default_db_path()); print(run_session_start_sync(s)); s.close()"
```

If `git pull` fails (local edits), say so — do not force. User commits or stashes first.

## While API is running (automatic)

With `start-api.ps1` up (default env):

| Sync | Interval | What |
|------|----------|------|
| Brother **videos + code + deletions** | **~10 min** | `BROTHER_SYNC_MINUTES=10` (default) — scoped library pull, deletion log, import, code ff-pull |

Skips code pull if tracked files are dirty locally.

## After any commit that should be shared

```powershell
git push origin
git push chris
```

Do not leave one remote behind.

## After a finished motivational video (Stephen)

```powershell
python scripts/shared_library_sync.py push-stephen
git push origin
git push chris
```

## Manual Chris sync

```powershell
git pull --ff-only origin main
python scripts/shared_library_sync.py pull-import --skip-pull
```

Or **Sync now** on `/library`.

**Media** uses Git LFS (`git lfs install` once per machine).

Full command list: `.cursor/skills/brother-sync/SKILL.md`.
